messages:  [["Please act as a math teacher and solve the product problem in the given template.\n####\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of <<number1 such as 27>> and <<number2 such as 153>>?\n# Reasoning:\nLet's think step by step. <<number2 153 has three digits, so that we can reason in three steps.>>\n1. <<Multiply number1 27 by the ones place digit 3 of number2 153>>\n2. <<Multiply number1 27 by the tens place digit 50 of number2 153>>\n<<other digits of number2 if it has>>\nAnswer:\nNow, sum all the step results: <<sum of the results>>.\nSo, the final computed product is <<answer>>.\n####\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of 188 and 549?\nI think the correct answer is: 503212\n# Reasoning:", "<think>\n\nTo find the product of 188 and 549, I'll break down the multiplication into manageable parts.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 188 by the units digit of 549, which is 9. This gives me 1,692.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 188 by the tens digit of 549, which is 40. This results in 7,520.\n\nFinally, I'll multiply 188 by the hundreds digit of 549, which is 500. This gives me 94,000.\n\nNow, I'll add all these partial products together: 1,692 + 7,520 + 94,000. This sum will provide the final product.\n</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
